{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secretly live in a stranger\u2019s house, watch your new family, and survive without getting caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Header.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>They don\u2019t know you exist\u2014but to you, they are family.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In<strong> <i>My Stranger Family</i></strong>, you step into the shoes of a hidden intruder. Follow the story of a family that knows nothing about your presence. Try to survive, find food, sneak into rooms, and make it through the night without raising suspicion. Every move you make matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stealth &amp; Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Stealth.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sneak around the house without being seen. Stay hidden as you observe the family\u2019s daily routines and use the environment to your advantage. Explore their home and blend in with their world without them ever knowing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survival Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Survival.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your needs and health matter. Eat well, rest, and take care of yourself while living with your new family. Maintain your health to stay alive. Every decision you make affects your survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chores &amp; Cleaning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Chores.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep the house tidy without drawing attention. Clean up messes, organize items, and ensure everything is in its place. A messy home could raise suspicion and make your life even harder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stories &amp; Dynamic Family Behavior</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Routine.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe the family\u2019s daily life. Each member has their own routine and personal stories. It\u2019s up to you to figure out how and when to interact with them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Open-Ended Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Sandbox.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With sandbox-style freedom, you can choose how to approach every situation. Interact with objects and experiment with different ways to survive. The house is yours to explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Protect Your Family</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Protect.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch over your family from the shadows. Keep them safe without ever revealing yourself, ensuring their safety while staying hidden.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549140?t=1744053682","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/3def7b5aeab76da2eca5fac361386c296df49283/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744053682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/a174b62007e9bcdc4bbd98ca76d3d74c8bd9e901/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744053682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/a174b62007e9bcdc4bbd98ca76d3d74c8bd9e901/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744053682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains mature themes, including violence, dark humor, suggestive content, and unsettling situations. Viewer discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secretly live in a stranger\u2019s house, watch your new family, and survive without getting caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Header.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>They don\u2019t know you exist\u2014but to you, they are family.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In<strong> <i>My Stranger Family</i></strong>, you step into the shoes of a hidden intruder. Follow the story of a family that knows nothing about your presence. Try to survive, find food, sneak into rooms, and make it through the night without raising suspicion. Every move you make matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stealth &amp; Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Stealth.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sneak around the house without being seen. Stay hidden as you observe the family\u2019s daily routines and use the environment to your advantage. Explore their home and blend in with their world without them ever knowing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survival Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Survival.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your needs and health matter. Eat well, rest, and take care of yourself while living with your new family. Maintain your health to stay alive. Every decision you make affects your survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chores &amp; Cleaning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Chores.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep the house tidy without drawing attention. Clean up messes, organize items, and ensure everything is in its place. A messy home could raise suspicion and make your life even harder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stories &amp; Dynamic Family Behavior</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Routine.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe the family\u2019s daily life. Each member has their own routine and personal stories. It\u2019s up to you to figure out how and when to interact with them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Open-Ended Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Sandbox.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With sandbox-style freedom, you can choose how to approach every situation. Interact with objects and experiment with different ways to survive. The house is yours to explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Protect Your Family</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/extras/GIF_Protect.gif?t=1744053682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch over your family from the shadows. Keep them safe without ever revealing yourself, ensuring their safety while staying hidden.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2>","developers":["MADPUG"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"h