":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549140/9894b7857d0d460fa1c9799001b74521cbff7673/ss_9894b7857d0d460fa1c9799001b74521cbff7673.600x338.jpg?t=1744053682"}],"short_description":"Secretly live in a stranger's house. Find food, get some sleep, and take care of your basic needs. Stay healthy while observing your new family. Watch how they live their lives. Sneak around, survive... DON\u2019T GET CAUGHT AND DON\u2019T DIE!","steam_appid":3549140,"support_info":{"email":"madpug.dev@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}